    "teach_6": {
      "id": "teach_6",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "The classic 'more people, half the time, many times the work' question is just one equation.\n\nIf x workers do one job in t days, then to do 8 jobs in t/2 days requires 16x workers — eight times the work in half the time.",
